# Copy to `.env` for `alchemy dev`. Every API route but /api/health requires
# `Authorization: Bearer $API_TOKEN`. Use a long random value when deploying.
API_TOKEN=local-dev-token

# The model provider's key is NOT set here. It is `API_PROVIDER_KEY` in the
# account's Cloudflare Secrets Store (`default_secrets_store`), created out of
# band with `wrangler secrets-store secret create`. alchemy.run.ts only looks
# it up and binds it; deploys never create, change or delete it.
